      "message": "I think so:\n\nhash_for_each_possible(hash_table, uid_entry, hash, uid)\n -\u003e  bkt \u003d hash_min(uid, HASH_BITS(hash_table)\n    -\u003e hlist_for_each_entry(uid_entry, \u0026hash_table[bkt])], hash)\n \nfor_each_uid_entry(uid_entry, bkt) \n -\u003e hlist_for_each_entry(uid_entry, \u0026hash_table[bkt], hash)",
