      "writtenOn": "2024-03-20T19:21:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This isn\u0027t quite the same logic as what the for loop before has. I do like the simplification, but think a `break` would probably more correct then `continue`.\n\nAlso I\u0027d lower the uid_entry check to be below the point where it is set in the loop rather then checking the previous iteration.",
